# Connections.mmd

## Purpose
An authoritative, high-level graph of which regions connect to which.

## Context
Read first:
- `GENRE.md`
- `setting/region/Regions.md`

## Instructions
Show the connections between regions at a high level as an authoritative representation of their relationship. No indicator of connection type or quantity is needed at this level, just that the connection exists (A connects to B, B connects to A and C, C connects to B, etc).

## Template
```mermaid
graph LR
    A["A - [Region Name]"] --- B["B - [Region Name]"]
```
